29=
30=v1.1
31=+ The `dnscrypt-proxy` package is no longer required
32=+ Fully autonomous `RPM` and `DEB` packages (self-contained)
33=+ Own systemd service - `/etc/systemd/user/dnscrypt-proxy.service`
34=+ The latest `dnscrypt-proxy` (v2.1.14) build from the developer's github is already inside
35=
36=**Note:** For a clean install and use, you need to remove `dnscrypt-proxy` if it was installed from the repository.
37=
